                  "Knowledge scores nearly doubled, from four point oh seven to seven point nine four, and two weeks later they were still at seven point six seven. Confidence in being able to protect themselves rose clearly too. And the source workers said they learned most from was not the posters or the Facebook page. It was the volunteers, their own co-workers: half of the people surveyed pointed to them.",
                  "ความรู้และความมั่นใจ", "Knowledge and confidence",
