                  "Does who you are matter? Of the five things asked, only education did: people with more schooling accepted the investment more readily. Age, gender, income and investing experience made no difference at all. And most of those surveyed rated their own crypto knowledge as a little to moderate; only two point five percent called themselves experts.",
                  "ใครเป็นใคร", "Who they are",
